e=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">angekommene,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">suchte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">er</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">ein</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">Hotel.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>In der Stadt angekommen, suchte er ein Hotel.</b></div>분사구문의 분사는 명사를 꾸미지 않아서 어미가 붙지 않아요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"36\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 36</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"